-v-f2d24994>We collect reviews from the world&#39;s top critics.</li><li data-v-f2d24994>Each review is scored based on its overall quality.</li><li data-v-f2d24994>The summarized weighted average captures the essence of critical opinion.</li></ul><a href="/about-us/" data-v-f2d24994 data-slot="base" class="font-medium aria-disabled:cursor-not-allowed aria-disabled:opacity-75 inline-flex items-center no-underline cursor-pointer border-solid ring-0 shadow-none outline-0 rounded-[0.3rem] transition-all duration-[150ms] ease-[ease] disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:pointer-events-none py-1.5 gap-1.5 h-8 text-sm leading-[26px] px-4 w-full aria-disabled:bg-inverted focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-inverted border border-gray-600 bg-gray-800 text-white hover:bg-gray-600 active:bg-gray-600 [&amp;_svg]:stroke-white disabled:bg-gray-200 disabled:border-none disabled:text-gray-600 disabled:opacity-100! justify-center c-section-about__button"><!--[--><!--[--><!----><!--]--><!--[--><!--[-->Learn More<!--]--><!--]--><!--[--><!----><!--]--><!--]--></a></div></div></div><!--]--></div><div class="front-door__ad-2" data-v-7c8d1bce><div class="fandom-ad-wrapper fandom-ad-placeholder min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px] min-[768px]:min-w-[728px] min-[768px]:min-h-[250px] min-[1024px]:min-w-[970px] min-[1024px]:min-h-[250px] fandom-ad-slot-type-display pt-4 px-0 pb-0 bg-gray-50" data-v-7c8d1bce data-v-0330ea43><!--[--><fandom-ad id="incontent_leaderboard_2" class="fandom-ad-placeholder min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px] min-[768px]:min-w-[728px] min-[768px]:min-h-[250px] min-[1024px]:min-w-[970px] min-[1024px]:min-h-[250px]" data-ad-unit-path="/5441/metacritic.display/incontent_leaderboard_2/desktop/front_door" data-v-95726591></fandom-ad><div id="label-incontent_leaderboard_2" class="fandom-ad-label ae-translatable-label" data-v-a20209ff>Advertisement</div><!--]--></div></div><div class="front-door__latest-news" data-testid="latest-news-carousel" data-v-7c8d1bce><!--[--><div data-testid="latest-news"><div class="global-carousel" data-v-6c45f90d><div class="global-header flex flex-col font-[&#39;Proxima_Nova&#39;,sans-serif] global-carousel__header" show-title-border="false" data-v-6c45f90d><div class="global-header__container flex w-full flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4"><div class="global-header__heading--empty pb-0 global-header__heading flex w-full items-center justify-between gap-4"><!--[--><div class="global-header-title flex w-full items-center justify-between md:justify-start"><h2 class="m-0 font-[var(--font-family-headings,&quot;Proxima_Nova&quot;,sans-serif)] font-bold text-[length:var(--global-header-title-h2-font-size)] leading-[var(--global-header-title-h2-line-height)] global-header-title__text">Latest News <!----></h2><!----><!----></div><!--]--><!----></div><!----></div><!--[--><!----><!--]--></div><div class="global-carousel__content-container" data-v-6c45f90d><section style="--desktop-columns:6;--tablet-columns:5;--mobile-columns:1;" class="px-0 mt-6 global-carousel_content-scrollable_gap-large global-carousel_content-scrollable_mobile-gap-large global-carousel_content" aria-label="Latest News content" data-v-6c45f90d><!--[--><!--[--><div class="w-full" data-testid="article-card" data-v-896515d0><a href="/news/xbox-game-pass-library/" rel="follow" target="_self" data-v-896515d0><!--[--><div data-testid="article-card-content" class="group grid gap-4 h-full grid-cols-1" data-v-896515d0><!----><div class="flex h-full flex-col justify-between gap-1 md:gap-4" data-v-896515d0><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:gap-4" data-v-896515d0><h3 class="m-0 line-clamp-3 underline decoration-1 underline-offset-3 text-gray-800 group-hover:no-underline group-hover:text-gray-600 text-2xl leading-8 md:text-base md:leading-5" data-testid="article-card-title" data-v-896515d0>Every Game Available for Xbox Game Pass</h3><div class="flex flex-col gap-2" data-v-896515d0><h4 class="m-0 text-xs leading-4 font-normal md:font-bold text-gray-800" data-testid="article-card-author" data-v-896515d0>Jason Dietz</h4><p class="text-base leading-5 md:text-xs md:leading-4" data-testid="article-card-description" data-v-896515d0><span class="line-clamp-3" data-v-896515d0>Find an up-to-date list of every game available in the Xbox Game Pass (and PC Game Pass) library at all membership levels, and find out which games are coming soon and leaving soon.</span></p></div></div><div class="border-t-gray-400 border-t pt-4" data-testid="article-card-tags" data-v-896515d0><ul class="global-tag-list" data-testid="tag-list" data-v-896515d0 data-v-7ad7b67c><!--[--><li class="global-tag-list__item" data-v-7ad7b67c><span class="global-tag-list__button" data-v-7ad7b67c>game</span></li><!--]--></ul></div></div></div><!--]--></a></div><div class="w-full" data-testid="article-card" data-v-896515d0><a href="/news/dvd-blu-ray-new-and-upcoming-release-calendar/" rel="follow" target="_self" data-v-896515d0><!--[--><div data-testid="article-card-content" class="group grid gap-4 h-full grid-cols-1" data-v-896515d0><!----><div class="flex h-full flex-col justify-between gap-1 md:gap-4" data-v-896515d0><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 md:gap-4" data-v-896515d0><h3 class="m-0 line-clamp-3 underline decoration-1 underline-offset-3 text-gray-800 group-hover:no-underline group-hover:text-gray-600 text-2xl leading-8 md:text-base md:leading-5" data-testid="article-card-title" data-v-896515d0>DVD/Blu-ray Releases: New &amp; Upcoming</h3><div class="flex flex-col gap-2" data-v-896515d0><h4 class="m-0 text-xs leading-4 font-normal md:font-bold text-gray-800" data-testid="article-card-author" data-v-896515d0>Jason Dietz</h4><p class="text-base leading-5 md:text-xs md:leading-4" data-testid="article-card-description" data-v-896515d0><span class="line-clamp-3" data-v-896515d0>Find a list of new movie and TV releases on DVD and Blu-ray (updated weekly) as well as a calendar of upcoming releases on home video.<