slug: mc-editorial-spotlight)",[2264,2302,2336,2366,2396,2425],{"id":2265,"title":1563,"promoTitle":1563,"type":2266,"author":2267,"datePublished":2274,"description":2277,"label":1440,"metaData":2278,"image":2279,"slug":2290,"topic":2291,"topics":2295,"tags":2299,"url":1440,"body":1440,"wordCount":18},"ad7062e3-0031-4942-96f5-a2ab6977a238","content_gallery",{"id":2268,"username":2269,"firstName":2270,"lastName":2271,"socialProfileIds":2272,"image":1440,"middleName":1440,"authorBio":1440,"title":1440,"suppressProfile":1148,"typeName":2273,"byline":1440},"c72d7a8f-c754-4842-8f22-0575700c03ab","kkimbell-mc","Keith","Kimbell",{"facebookProfile":1440,"facebookPage":1440,"twitter":1440,"googlePlus":1440,"instagram":1440},"user_user",{"date":2275,"timezone":2276,"timezone_type":29},"2026-09-01 21:37:00","UTC","Our editors select the most noteworthy films debuting in September 2026, including a reboot of Resident Evil.",{"slideCount":1440,"duration":1440,"reviewType":1440,"typeTitle":1440,"hubTopicPathString":1440,"preferredProductName":1440,"rating":1440,"linkUrl":1440,"origin":1440},{"id":2280,"filename":2281,"dateCreated":2282,"alt":2284,"credits":2285,"caption":2286,"path":2287,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"typeName":2288,"width":2031,"height":2289,"bucketPath":1440,"bucketType":1440},"de45c7b4-d13f-4787-bd53-76a1b0474b13","moviepreview-2026-09-residentevil.jpg",{"date":2283,"timezone":2276,"timezone_type":29},"2026-09-01 21:38:40","September 2026 Movie Preview","\"Resident Evil (2026)\" (Sony\u002FColumbia Pictures\u002FDušan Martinček)","\u003Cp>The month ahead will bring Zach Cregger's take on Resident Evil, an Oasis documentary, the return of Shaun the Sheep, and more. To help you plan your moviegoing options, our editors have selected the most notable films releasing in September, listed in alphabetical order.\u003C\u002Fp>","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.metacritic.com\u002Fa\u002Fimg\u002F2026\u002F09\u002F01\u002Fde45c7b4-d13f-4787-bd53-76a1b0474b13\u002Fmoviepreview-2026-09-residentevil.jpg","content_image",486,"september-2026-movie-preview",{"id":2292,"slug":1923,"name":2293,"topicPath":2294},"6ce988a6-114b-4569-91bb-a579fa746f3c","Movie",[],[2296],{"primary":49,"id":2292,"name":2293,"slug":1923,"typeName":2297,"topicPath":2298},"content_topic",[],[2300],{"primary":49,"id":2292,"name":2293,"slug":1923,"typeName":2297,"topicPath":2301},[],{"id":2303,"title":1655,"promoTitle":1655,"type":2266,"author":2304,"datePublished":2311,"description":2313,"label":1440,"metaData":2314,"image":2315,"slug":2324,"topic":2325,"topics":2330,"tags":2333,"url":1440,"body":1440,"wordCount":18},"a739398b-02c8-4113-b485-e9949a325455",{"id":2305,"username":2306,"firstName":2307,"lastName":2308,"socialProfileIds":2309,"image":1440,"middleName":1440,"authorBio":1440,"title":2310,"suppressProfile":1148,"typeName":2273,"byline":2310},"f7f44456-092c-4f95-8f00-6184bbe20726","jdietzmc","Jason","Dietz",{"facebookProfile":1440,"facebookPage":1440,"twitter":1440,"googlePlus":1440,"instagram":1440},"Metacritic Features Editor",{"date":2312,"timezone":2276,"timezone_type":29},"2026-08-28 23:02:00","Get details on the most notable new and returning shows debuting in September 2026, including Slow Horses, Jay-Z in 8, and more.",{"slideCount":1440,"duration":1440,"reviewType":1440,"typeTitle":1440,"hubTopicPathString":1440,"preferredProductName":1440,"rating":1440,"linkUrl":1440,"origin":1440},{"id":2316,"filename":2317,"dateCreated":2318,"alt":2320,"credits":2321,"caption":2322,"path":2323,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"typeName":2288,"width":2031,"height":2289,"bucketPath":1440,"bucketType":1440},"08ca9888-7cc6-47c7-924d-7615c0d93e25","tv-preview-2026-09-slowhorses.jpg",{"date":2319,"timezone":2276,"timezone_type":29},"2026-08-28 22:37:29","September 2026 TV Preview","\"Slow Horses\" (Apple)","\u003Cp>The month ahead will bring the returns of&nbsp;\u003Cem>Slow Horses\u003C\u002Fem>&nbsp;and&nbsp;\u003Cem>The Gentlemen\u003C\u002Fem>, a sequel to&nbsp;\u003Cem>Snowfall\u003C\u002Fem>, a spinoff from&nbsp;\u003Cem>Reacher\u003C\u002Fem>, an in-depth look at Jay-Z, and more. To help you plan your viewing options, our editors have selected the most interesting TV and movie titles debuting at home in September, listed in order by premiere date.\u003C\u002Fp>","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.metacritic.com\u002Fa\u002Fimg\u002F2026\u002F08\u002F28\u002F08ca9888-7cc6-47c7-924d-7615c0d93e25\u002Ftv-preview-2026-09-slowhorses.jpg","september-2026-tv-preview",{"id":2326,"slug":2327,"name":2328,"topicPath":2329},"bb8df62e-aee6-440d-a03f-0520b28e2706","tv-show","TV Show",[],[2331],{"primary":49,"id":2326,"name":2328,"slug":2327,"typeName":2297,"topicPath":2332},[],[2334],{"primary":49,"id":2326,"name":2328,"slug":2327,"typeName":2297,"topicPath":2335},[],{"id":2337,"title":2338,"promoTitle":2338,"type":2266,"author":2339,"datePublished":2345,"description":2347,"label":1440,"metaData":2348,"image":2349,"slug":2357,"topic":2358,"topics":2360,"tags":2363,"url":1440,"body":1440,"wordCount":18},"40813e50-f46a-4966-a1b6-c09fef19d120","20 Great 90s Indie Films to Stream Now",{"id":2340,"username":2341,"firstName":2342,"lastName":2343,"socialProfileIds":2344,"image":1440,"middleName":1440,"authorBio":1440,"title":1440,"suppressProfile":1148,"typeName":2273,"byline":1440},"7974d639-0d7a-4f9d-bc19-92d8e0ac3199","nickhyman","Nick","Hyman",{"facebookProfile":1440,"facebookPage":1440,"twitter":1440,"googlePlus":1440,"instagram":1440},{"date":2346,"timezone":2276,"timezone_type":29},"2026-08-24 22:33:59","The 1990s were a golden age for indie cinema. Here is a diverse selction of 20 acclaimed indie and arthouse films from the decade—each scoring 81 or higher—that you can stream right now.",{"slideCount":1440,"duration":1440,"reviewType":1440,"typeTitle":1440,"hubTopicPathString":1440,"preferredProductName":1440,"rating":1440,"linkUrl":1440,"origin":1440},{"id":2350,"filename":2351,"dateCreated":2352,"alt":2338,"credits":2354,"caption":2355,"path":2356,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"typeName":2288,"width":2031,"height":2289,"bucketPath":1440,"bucketType":1440},"9c67d358-60e4-4aba-939c-a315b672b2a1","welcometothedollhousealt.jpg",{"date":2353,"timezone":2276,"timezone_type":29},"2026-08-24 22:07:59","\"Welcome to the Dollhouse\" (Sony Pictures Classics)","\u003Cp>The 1990s are widely remembered as a golden age for independent cinema. Freed from the constraints of major studio formulas, visionary directors unleashed ground-breaking narratives, bold visual styles, and unforgettable characters that redefined American and international filmmaking. From Sundance breakouts to global art-house sensations, independent cinema during this iconic decade offered a crucial counterweight to Hollywood blockbusters, fostering an environment where auteur voices could flourish with unprecedented freedom.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To celebrate this transformative era, we have curated a list of 20 arthouse classics from the 1990s that you can currently watch from the comfort of your couch. To qualify for our selection, every feature on this list had to meet two main criteria: a Metascore of 81 or higher (meaning they received massive critical acclaim) and current availability on one or more major streaming platforms or digital rental outlets. Listed alphabetically below, these masterworks showcase the boundless creativity, emotional depth, and raw talent that made '90s indie cinema legendary.\u003C\u002Fp>","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.metacritic.com\u002Fa\u002Fimg\u002F2026\u002F08\u002F24\u002F9c67d358-60e4-4aba-939c-a315b672b2a1\u002Fwelcometothedollhousealt.jpg","20-great-1990s-indie-films-to-stream-now",{"id":2292,"slug":1923,"name":2293,"topicPath":2359},[],[2361],{"primary":49,"id":2292,"name":2293,"slug":1923,"typeName":2297,"topicPath":2362},[],[2364],{"primary":49,"id":2292,"name":2293,"slug":1923,"typeName":2297,"topicPath":2365},[],{"id":2367,"title":2368,"promoTitle":2368,"type":2266,"author":2369,"datePublished":2375,"description":2377,"label":1440,"metaData":2378,"image":2379,"slug":2387,"topic":2388,"topics":2390,"tags":2393,"url":1440,"body":1440,"wordCount":18},"8069c1b3-1093-4f09-8f5a-8adff45e644a","Live-Action DC Comics TV Shows, Ranked",{"id":2370,"username":2371,"firstName":2372,"lastName":2373,"socialProfileIds":2374,"image":1440,"middleName":1440,"authorBio":1440,"title":1440,"suppressProfile":1148,"typeName":2273,"byline":1440},"eca1288f-e3e3-4535-86e4-d4b1e23ef848","liammathewsmc","Liam","Mathews",{"facebookProfile":1440,"facebookPage":1440,"twitter":1440,"googlePlus":1440,"instagram":1440},{"date":2376,"timezone":2276,"timezone_type":29},"2026-08-17 19:27:00","We rank every live-action DC Comics television adaptation of the 21st century, including the newest series, Lanterns.",{"slideCount":1440,"duration":1440,"reviewType":1440,"typeTitle":1440,"hubTopicPathString":1440,"preferredProductName":1440,"rating":1440,"linkUrl":1440,"origin":1440},{"id":2380,"filename":2381,"dateCreated":2382,"alt":2368,"credits":2384,"caption":2385,"path":2386,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"typeName":2288,"width":2031,"height":2289,"bucketPath":1440,"bucketType":1440},"4f1e59d6-d171-446b-8107-e47a45f811fb","maindccomicstvshows.jpg",{"date":2383,"timezone":2276,"timezone_type":29},"2026-08-17 19:11:42","\"Watchmen\" (Mark Hill\u002FHBO)","\u003Cp>DC Comics has had a presence on television going back to&nbsp;\u003Cem>Adventures of Superman\u003C\u002Fem>&nbsp;in the 1950s. Since then, there have been an infinite (Earths) number of shows based on DC characters, from Adam West's&nbsp;\u003Cem>Batman\u003C\u002Fem>&nbsp;in the 1960s through the sprawling, interconnected Arrowverse in the 2010s, and to the movie spinoffs of today's DC Extended Universe. With the latest DC Comics show,&nbsp;\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.metacritic.com\u002Ftv\u002Flanterns\u002F\">Lanterns\u003C\u002Fa>, now streaming its debut episode on HBO Max, we're taking a look back at DC TV shows to see how that newest show compares.\u003C\u002Fp>\u003Cp>To keep what could have been a very long list a more manageable size, our ranking only includes live-action shows from the 21st century (so no&nbsp;\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.metacritic.com\u002Ftv\u002Flois-clark-the-new-adventures-of-superman\u002F\">Lois &amp; Clark\u003C\u002Fa>&nbsp;or&nbsp;\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.metacritic.com\u002Ftv\u002Fbatman-the-animated-series\u002F\">Batman: The Animated Series\u003C\u002Fa>) and no DC sub-brands (so no Vertigo titles like&nbsp;\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.metacritic.com\u002Ftv\u002Fizombie\u002F\">iZombie\u003C\u002Fa>). That still leaves us with 25 shows, and they are ranked by Metascore, with higher numbers on our 0-100 scale equating to better overall reviews from top professional critics.\u003C\u002Fp>","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.metacritic.com\u002Fa\u002Fimg\u002F2026\u002F08\u002F17\u002F4f1e59d6-d171-446b-8107-e47a45f811fb\u002Fmaindccomicstvshows.jpg","live-action-dc-comics-tv-shows-ranked-worst-to-best",{"id":2326,"slug":2327,"name":2328,"topicPath":2389},[],[2391],{"primary":49,"id":2326,"name":2328,"slug":2327,"typeName":2297,"topicPath":2392},[],[2394],{"primary":49,"id":2326,"name":2328,"slug":2327,"typeName":2297,"topicPath":2395},[],{"id":2397,"title":2398,"promoTitle":2398,"type":2399,"author":2400,"datePublished":2402,"description":2404,"label":1440,"metaData":2405,"image":2407,"slug":2415,"topic":2416,"topics":2418,"tags":2421,"url":1440,"body":1440,"wordCount":2424},"7c6b8790-1cd4-4277-bfef-d6b4688bad48","2026-27 TV Premiere Calendar","content_article",{"id":2305,"username":2306,"firstName":2307,"lastName":2308,"socialProfileIds":2401,"image":1440,"middleName":1440,"authorBio":1440,"title":2310,"suppressProfile":1148,"typeName":2273,"byline":2310},{"facebookProfile":1440,"facebookPage":1440,"twitter":1440,"googlePlus":1440,"instagram":1440},{"date":2403,"timezone":2276,"timezone_type":29},"2026-08-18 23:10:00","Find a frequently updated calendar of premiere dates for all upcoming new and returning television shows on broadcast, streaming, and cable, plus TV movies and specials and VOD releases.",{"slideCount":1440,"duration":1440,"reviewType":1440,"typeTitle":2406,"hubTopicPathString":1440,"preferredProductName":1440,"rating":1440,"linkUrl":1440,"origin":1440},"Features",{"id":2408,"filename":2409,"dateCreated":2410,"alt":2412,"credits":2413,"caption":1815,"path":2414,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"typeName":2288,"width":2031,"height":2289,"bucketPath":1440,"bucketType":1440},"1f722145-54b2-4f09-b20b-15b635c772ec","tvcalendar-2026-09-slowhorses.jpg",{"date":2411,"timezone":2276,"timezone_type":29},"2026-08-18 23:13:42","tvcalendar-fall2023fargo","FX Networks","https:\u002F\u002Fwww.metacritic.com\u002Fa\u002Fimg\u002F2026\u002F08\u002F18\u002F1f722145-54b2-4f09-b20b-15b635c772ec\u002Ftvcalendar-2026-09-slowhorses.jpg","tv-premiere-dates",{"id":2326,"slug":2327,"name":2328,"topicPath":2417},[],[2419],{"primary":49,"id":2326,"name":2328,"slug":2327,"typeName":2297,"topicPath":2420},[],[2422],{"primary":49,"id":2326,"name":2328,"slug":2327,"typeName":2297,"topicPath":2423},[],8275,{"id":2426,"title":1468,"promoTitle":1468,"type":2266,"author":2427,"datePublished":2433,"description":2435,"label":1440,"metaData":2436,"image":2437,"slug":2446,"topic":2447,"topics":2452,"tags":2455,"url":1440,"body":1440,"wordCount":18},"d8e80ed8-e56b-419c-9203-f48854f3cda6",{"id":2428,"username":2429,"firstName":2430,"lastName":2431,"socialProfileIds":2432,"image":1440,"middleName":1440,"authorBio":1440,"title":1440,"suppressProfile":1148,"typeName":2273,"byline":1440},"ef96ef34-030b-4f05-a9c3-b1186a8bdd4e","philowenmc","Phil","Owen",{"facebookProfile":1440,"facebookPage":1440,"twitter":1440,"googlePlus":1440,"instagram":1440},{"date":2434,"timezone":2276,"timezone_type":29},"2026-08-02 14:00:00","Get details on the most notable video game releases expected in August and September 2026, including Marvel's Wolverine and new ins