pe":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1788147585.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},341,504,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1788147585.jpg",{"url":4571,"max":41,"score":4572,"reviewCount":247,"positiveCount":45,"neutralCount":45,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},"\u002Fgame\u002Fmoonlighter-2-the-endless-vault\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",76,[4574],{"id":1440,"name":4575},"Action RPG","Will is back to business in this Action-RPG with roguelike elements!\r\n\r\nWith no coin to your name, you and the other townsfolk find yourselves stranded in the distant village of Tresna. Now, it’s up to you to get back on your feet and turn your humble shop into the beating heart of the village’s wealth. \r\n\r\nExplore dangerous dungeons, gather relics, sell them, and reinvest in your friends’ establishments. Unlock new weapons, armor, shop decorations, and - more importantly - restore hope that things can one day turn around.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":1440},{"id":1950,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":1522,"slug":1951,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4580,"rating":1440,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4581,"criticScoreSummary":4583,"genres":4584,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4587,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4588,"userScore":4589},"2026-09-01",{"id":1440,"filename":1962,"dateCreated":4582,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":1964,"height":1965,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":1966,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},{"url":1970,"max":41,"score":1971,"reviewCount":240,"positiveCount":29,"neutralCount":45,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1972},[4585],{"id":1440,"name":4586},"Action Adventure","Crimson Moon is a Gothic High Renaissance action-adventure RPG built around intense, replayable missions that blend brutal precision with deep character progression. Set in the besieged city of Gildenarch, players hack and slash their way through cathedrals, battlements, and shadowed districts overrun by demons, vampires, and undead gods. Players can venture alone or bring a friend in optional co-op as they wield angelic power and fight back the Infernal Legion.  ",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":1440},{"id":2154,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":2155,"slug":2156,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4591,"rating":4592,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4593,"criticScoreSummary":4595,"genres":4596,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4598,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4599,"userScore":4600},"2026-08-28","M",{"id":1440,"filename":2166,"dateCreated":4594,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":1964,"height":1965,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":2168,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},{"url":2172,"max":41,"score":25,"reviewCount":2073,"positiveCount":2124,"neutralCount":18,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":2174},[4597],{"id":1440,"name":4575},"With over 28 million copies sold worldwide, ELDEN RING is an award-winning, action RPG set in an authentic dark fantasy world. Explore treacherous dungeons and face epic boss battles. \r\n\r\nELDEN RING Tarnished Edition on Nintendo Switch 2 includes the base game, SHADOW OF THE ERDTREE, and new weapons, armour Torrent skins, and more.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":4601},7.8,{"id":4603,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4604,"slug":4605,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4591,"rating":4606,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4607,"criticScoreSummary":4612,"genres":4614,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4617,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4618,"userScore":4619},1300721432,"Captain Tsubasa 2: World Fighters","captain-tsubasa-2-world-fighters","E",{"id":1440,"filename":4608,"dateCreated":4609,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":2115,"height":4610,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":4611,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1787758352.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},430,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1787758352.jpg",{"url":4613,"max":41,"score":4572,"reviewCount":1414,"positiveCount":1423,"neutralCount":983,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},"\u002Fgame\u002Fcaptain-tsubasa-2-world-fighters\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[4615],{"id":1440,"name":4616},"Soccer","The next episode of Tsubasa’s riveting adventure is here! Enjoy the thrill of spectacular soccer actions with 110 playable characters and new sensational super moves. \r\n\r\nCAPTAIN TSUBASA 2: WOLRD FIGHTERS invites fans to follow their journey to victory by creating their own character and joining Tsubasa on his quest. Players will forge new friendships, fight new rivals, and bring the trophy back home.\r\n\r\nAction on the field has been significantly enhanced for this new release. New super moves increase the intensity of every part of the game, allowing players to dominate the field when they pass, dribble, tackle or block with their own special techniques.\r\n\r\nEven blocking goal shots becomes more tactical with a new system that pits goalkeeper against shooter, letting both players experience and counter jaw dropping super shots and blocks from characters of the original series.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":4620},6.2,{"id":4622,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4623,"slug":4624,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4625,"rating":4626,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4627,"criticScoreSummary":4632,"genres":4635,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4638,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4639,"userScore":4640},1300722469,"Brigandine Abyss","brigandine-abyss","2026-08-27","T",{"id":1440,"filename":4628,"dateCreated":4629,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":1965,"height":4630,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":4631,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1787241055.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},710,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1787241055.jpg",{"url":4633,"max":41,"score":4634,"reviewCount":547,"positiveCount":45,"neutralCount":240,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1972},"\u002Fgame\u002Fbrigandine-abyss\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",68,[4636],{"id":1440,"name":4637},"Turn-Based Tactics","Once upon a time, the world was saved by the Brigandine. This arcane armor, forged by the great sorcerer Lunadea, brought an end to the ambitions of the Abyssloa Empire.\r\n\r\n200 years have since passed, and the continent’s current greatest superpower, the Kingdom of Solginat, has grown into a disquieting presence. In response, the rulers of various nations, spearheaded by the queen of Mysteine - a realm that carries on Lunadea’s will - gather together to issue a formal denunciation...",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":1440},{"id":2103,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":1528,"slug":2104,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4625,"rating":4592,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4642,"criticScoreSummary":4644,"genres":4645,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4647,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4648,"userScore":4649},{"id":1440,"filename":2113,"dateCreated":4643,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":2115,"height":2116,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":2117,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},{"url":2121,"max":41,"score":2122,"reviewCount":1406,"positiveCount":2124,"neutralCount":1797,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},[4646],{"id":1440,"name":4586},"Set 15 years before A Plague Tale: Requiem, play as Sophia, a fierce young plunderer, on the run but determined to uncover the secrets of her past. Dive into an original story blending combat, myth and fate with a brand new take in the universe of A Plague Tale.\r\n\r\nSophia’s journey leads to the Minotaur' Island, where she faces deadly trials, navigates treacherous trails, solves puzzles, all while fighting and staying one step ahead of the army chasing her. But the true challenge awaits, as the terrifying creature hidden behind the myth will soon resonate with her...\r\n\r\nEvery step is a risk. Every pause, a potential end. You can’t stop, only hide, outsmart, and push forward. Can you survive each trial and every step or will you join those who never came back?",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":4650},8.1,{"id":4652,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4653,"slug":4654,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4625,"rating":4592,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4655,"criticScoreSummary":4661,"genres":4663,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4666,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4667,"userScore":4668},1300722476,"Metal Gear Solid: Master Collection Vol. 2","metal-gear-solid-master-collection-vol-2",{"id":1440,"filename":4656,"dateCreated":4657,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":4658,"height":4659,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":4660,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1787271776.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},388,561,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1787271776.jpg",{"url":4662,"max":41,"score":2070,"reviewCount":2044,"positiveCount":2100,"neutralCount":1238,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},"\u002Fgame\u002Fmetal-gear-solid-master-collection-vol-2\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[4664],{"id":1440,"name":4665},"Compilation","The extreme tension of infiltrating without being detected.\r\nMetal Gear series, the pinnacle of “stealth action” Immerse yourself in the Metal Gear series, the pinnacle of “stealth action” where you can infiltrate and elude your enemies to complete missions.\r\nThis collection is the second installment of the definitive Metal Gear Master Collection.\r\n\r\nVol. 2 includes Metal Gear Solid 4: Guns of the Patriots and Metal Gear Solid: Peace Walker (HD Collection version).\r\n\r\nEach game includes a Screenplay Book containing the text from the respective title, plus a Master Book offering detailed insights into the story and characters.\r\n\r\nAlso, as purchase bonuses for the collection edition, it includes METAL GEAR Ghost Babel—the series first title for handheld consoles, released in 2000—and Metal Gear Solid: Digital Soundtrack Vol.2, featuring numerous iconic tracks that enhanced Snake's missions, ranging from BGM used in the games to vocal songs.\r\n\r\n[Game List]\r\nMetal Gear Solid 4: Guns of the Patriots\r\nMetal Gear Solid: Peace Walker (HD Collection version)\r\nMetal Gear: Ghost Babel\r\n*Versions for other regions of Metal Gear Solid 4: Guns of the Patriots can be downloaded separately from the store.\r\n*Metal Gear Solid: Peace Walker (HD Collection version) supports online play for up to 6 players. ",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":4669},8.8,{"id":4671,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4672,"slug":4673,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4625,"rating":4674,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4675,"criticScoreSummary":4681,"genres":4683,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4686,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4687,"userScore":4688},1300696628,"Aggelos 2","aggelos-2","E10+",{"id":1440,"filename":4676,"dateCreated":4677,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":4678,"height":4679,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":4680,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1788246484.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},425,620,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1788246484.jpg",{"url":4682,"max":41,"score":4572,"reviewCount":247,"positiveCount":29,"neutralCount":1238,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},"\u002Fgame\u002Faggelos-2\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[4684],{"id":1440,"name":4685},"Metroidvania","Jump into an action-packed 2D retro Metroidvania adventure where reactive combat, smart exploration and powerful polarising abilities collide.\r\n\r\nAggelos 2 is a full evolution of the original, now thrusting the visuals into the 16-bit era. Its transformational twist takes the gameplay to another level, as the world now exists in two overlapping realms: Light and Darkness.\r\n\r\nYou are an Aggelos - the highest rank among the angels - as the gods face imminent defeat at the hands of the Army of Darkness, you are sent on an epic journey by Balro through Lumen, the domain of the supreme god of light. With Lumen under siege, you must battle through the chaos in both the Light and Dark worlds layered over one another. Both filled with challenging enemies, twisting paths, and thought-provoking puzzles. Shifting between realms is key to your survival and progress.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":1440},{"id":4690,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4691,"slug":4692,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4625,"rating":1440,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4693,"criticScoreSummary":4698,"genres":4700,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4703,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4704,"userScore":4705},1300575841,"Lou's Lagoon","lous-lagoon",{"id":1440,"filename":4694,"dateCreated":4695,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":4696,"height":1854,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":4697,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1787586365.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},369,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1787586365.jpg",{"url":4699,"max":41,"score":3871,"reviewCount":983,"positiveCount":29,"neutralCount":240,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1972},"\u002Fgame\u002Flous-lagoon\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[4701],{"id":1440,"name":4702},"Open-World Action","Launch from the sea and take to the skies! Lou's Lagoon is a cosy open world adventure where you make friends and uncover secrets across a gorgeous archipelago.\n\nCollect, harvest, fish, craft and trade various goods, then deliver them safely to the individual islands in your trusty seaplane. Customise and strengthen your plane over time, overcoming storms, pirates, and magic in order to reach new islanders. Forge new connections and service your community.\n\nSecrets lurk in the corners of every island. While completing deliveries, you'll also unearth treasures and find clues about your wacky uncle Lou.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":1440},{"id":2049,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":1531,"slug":2050,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4625,"rating":4626,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4707,"criticScoreSummary":4709,"genres":4710,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4712,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4713,"userScore":4714},{"id":1440,"filename":2061,"dateCreated":4708,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":2063,"height":2064,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":2065,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},{"url":2069,"max":41,"score":2070,"reviewCount":2072,"positiveCount":2073,"neutralCount":1238,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},[4711],{"id":1440,"name":4637},"Command an elite squad through a gritty and authentic story in STAR WARS Zero Company™, a single-player turn-based tactics game set in the twilight of the Clone Wars™. You will step into the shoes of Hawks, a former Republic officer who leads Zero Company as they are recruited for an operation that pits them against an emerging threat that will consume the galaxy if left unchecked.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":4601},{"id":4716,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4717,"slug":4718,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4719,"rating":1440,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4720,"criticScoreSummary":4724,"genres":4726,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4729,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4730,"userScore":4731},1300741503,"Blood Dungeon","blood-dungeon","2026-08-25",{"id":1440,"filename":4721,"dateCreated":4722,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":2622,"height":2116,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":4723,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1787679818.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1787679818.jpg",{"url":4725,"max":41,"score":2247,"reviewCount":983,"positiveCount":247,"neutralCount":29,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},"\u002Fgame\u002Fblood-dungeon\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[4727],{"id":1440,"name":4728},"2D Platformer","From the creators of Nidhogg comes a game about 2D platforming survival. You'll have to parkour your way around treacherous dungeons to kite monsters while gathering blood and powerups. \r\n\r\nSurvive a run, take the bones you’ve earned to the Bone Shop, and get stronger. \r\n\r\nComplete quests to unlock upgrades, arenas, skins, and more.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":1440},{"id":4733,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4734,"slug":4735,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4719,"rating":4592,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4736,"criticScoreSummary":4742,"genres":4744,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4747,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4748,"userScore":4749},1300735686,"Aliens: Fireteam Elite 2","aliens-fireteam-elite-2",{"id":1440,"filename":4737,"dateCreated":4738,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":4739,"height":4740,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":4741,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1787677331.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},319,483,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1787677331.jpg",{"url":4743,"max":41,"score":1971,"reviewCount":247,"positiveCount":1238,"neutralCount":29,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1972},"\u002Fgame\u002Faliens-fireteam-elite-2\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[4745],{"id":1440,"name":4746},"Third Person Shooter","This is a fight for survival. Xenomorphs swarm in overwhelming numbers. Every room could be your last. \r\n\r\nAliens: Fireteam Elite 2 drops up to four players into the boots of Colonial Marines deployed to the most hostile corners of the Aliens universe. This is not a rescue mission – it’s a fight for survival. Xenomorphs stalk the corridors, ambush from the shadows, and swarm in overwhelming numbers. Every room could be your last. Coordinate with your fireteam, leverage each class’s unique abilities, and adapt on the fly as encounters escalate from tense standoffs to all-out war. With deeper squad mechanics, smarter enemies, and a fully customizable Specialist class, AFE2 delivers the definitive co-op Aliens experience. \r\n\r\n4-Player Co-Op Squad Combat\r\nExpanding from three to four players, AFE2 introduces deeper team-based mechanics that reward coordination and strategic class composition. New and improved classes each bring distinct playstyles and tactical abilities to the fight, making every squad combination feel different. \r\n\r\nXenomorphs That Overwhelm You\r\nThe iconic xenomorphs are more ferocious than ever before. AFE2's massive variety of new xenomorphs will force players to stay mobile, maintain situational awareness, and use every tool at their disposal. From stun batons for up close melee action in those most desperate moments, to pyro and electric ammo to whittle down the unrelenting xenomorph front before they overrun you and your squad, the battle can shift from calculated tension to desperate last stand in seconds. \r\n\r\nThe Specialist Class -- Play Your Way\r\nBeyond expanded weapon and gear customization, AFE2 introduces the Specialist -- a fully customizable class that lets players mix and match major and minor abilities from every available class. Build a loadout tailored to your exact playstyle and fill whatever role your squad needs. \r\n\r\nHorde Mode -- Survive the Swarm\r\nAFE2 launches with multiple dedicated Horde maps that push squads to their limits. Battle through escalating waves of xenomorphs and other deadly enemies, earning increasingly valuable rewards as you survive deeper into the onslaught. This is where teamwork and skill are tested at their absolute peak.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":4750},6.3,{"id":4752,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4753,"slug":4754,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4755,"rating":1440,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4756,"criticScoreSummary":4762,"genres":4765,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4768,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4769,"userScore":4770},1300656484,"STEINS;GATE RE:BOOT","steinsgate-reboot","2026-08-20",{"id":1440,"filename":4757,"dateCreated":4758,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":4759,"height":4760,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":4761,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1786679452.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},264,418,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1786679452.jpg",{"url":4763,"max":41,"score":1860,"reviewCount":4764,"positiveCount":2592,"neutralCount":247,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},"\u002Fgame\u002Fsteinsgate-reboot\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",21,[4766],{"id":1440,"name":4767},"Visual Novel","STEINS;GATE returns! Rebooted for the modern era! Featuring fully updated visuals, UI, and an all-new story that breathes new life into the streets of Akihabara.\r\n",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":1440},{"id":4772,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4773,"slug":4774,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4755,"rating":4626,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4775,"criticScoreSummary":4781,"genres":4783,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4785,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4786,"userScore":4787},1300671042,"OVER REQUIEMZ","over-requiemz",{"id":1440,"filename":4776,"dateCreated":4777,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":4778,"height":4779,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":4780,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1787299381.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},238,401,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1787299381.jpg",{"url":4782,"max":41,"score":1860,"reviewCount":247,"positiveCount":247,"neutralCount":18,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},"\u002Fgame\u002Fover-requiemz\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[4784],{"id":1440,"name":4767},"You have wandered into Oz, a faraway kingdom ruled by four witches and the king, after being caught up in a terrifying tornado. \r\n\r\nBut you are not welcome. Sentenced to death upon arrival, you are ordered to investigate mysterious ruins along with four murderers on death row and a secretive supervisor of the condemned. \r\n\r\nYour only choice is to escape the death sentence and discover a way home.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":4788},6.8,{"id":4790,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4791,"slug":4792,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4755,"rating":1440,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4793,"criticScoreSummary":4799,"genres":4801,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4804,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4805,"userScore":4806},1300699095,"Gallipoli","gallipoli",{"id":1440,"filename":4794,"dateCreated":4795,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":4796,"height":4797,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":4798,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1787600079.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},151,283,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1787600079.jpg",{"url":4800,"max":41,"score":1860,"reviewCount":547,"positiveCount":240,"neutralCount":45,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},"\u002Fgame\u002Fgallipoli\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[4802],{"id":1440,"name":4803},"Tactical FPS","What began on mainland Europe, was never likely to end there... Prepare for relentless WW1 beach landings and desert warfare across the Middle Eastern Front in Gallipoli!\r\n\r\nFaced with the deadlocked trenches of the Western Front, the Triple Entente looked for new pathways to victory. What was thought to be a quick expeditionary campaign to remove a German ally from the war, ended up in a disastrous four-year campaign: the Ottoman Empire wasn’t going down without a fight.\r\n\r\nGallipoli marks the fourth entry in the WW1 Game Series, further broadening its authentic and realistic FPS combat experience to give you the deepest dive into the Middle Eastern Front of World War 1 yet.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":4807},7.1,{"id":4809,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4810,"slug":4811,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4755,"rating":1440,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4812,"criticScoreSummary":4818,"genres":4820,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4823,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4824,"userScore":4825},1300687467,"Mexican Ninja","mexican-ninja",{"id":1440,"filename":4813,"dateCreated":4814,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":4815,"height":4816,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":4817,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1787763887.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},274,421,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1787763887.jpg",{"url":4819,"max":41,"score":3871,"reviewCount":983,"positiveCount":247,"neutralCount":29,"negativeCount":1238,"sentiment":1972},"\u002Fgame\u002Fmexican-ninja\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[4821],{"id":1440,"name":4822},"3D Beat-'Em-Up","Become the Mexican Ninja and fight to take back Nuevo Tokyo, where Narcos and Yakuzas have fused into the ruthless Narkuzas. Master slick combos, unleash outrageous Mexican Jutsus and craft deadly builds in this fast, chaotic 2.5D roguelike beat ’em up.\r\n",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":1440},{"id":4827,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4828,"slug":4829,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4755,"rating":4626,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4830,"criticScoreSummary":4836,"genres":4839,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4842,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4843,"userScore":4844},1300619892,"Ground Zero Hero","ground-zero-hero",{"id":1440,"filename":4831,"dateCreated":4832,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":4833,"height":4834,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":4835,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1788321746.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},318,485,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1788321746.jpg",{"url":4837,"max":41,"score":4838,"reviewCount":247,"positiveCount":29,"neutralCount":18,"negativeCount":1238,"sentiment":1972},"\u002Fgame\u002Fground-zero-hero\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",70,[4840],{"id":1440,"name":4841},"Action"," Kill mutants. Absorb their remains. Mutate into something stronger every run. Stack insane power combos and survive overwhelming hordes in this fast, chaotic, highly replayable action roguelite bullet hell. ",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":1440},{"id":2203,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":1537,"slug":2204,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4755,"rating":1440,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4846,"criticScoreSummary":4848,"genres":4849,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4851,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4852,"userScore":4853},{"id":1440,"filename":2215,"dateCreated":4847,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":2217,"height":2218,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":2219,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},{"url":2223,"max":41,"score":1860,"reviewCount":2072,"positiveCount":2225,"neutralCount":977,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},[4850],{"id":1440,"name":4575}," Their Flesh Is Your Weapon. Mortal Shell II is a standalone sequel action-RPG with adrenaline-charged, high-stakes combat. Possess warrior Shells, dethrone false gods, redeem a ravaged world. ",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":4854},7.9,{"id":4856,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4857,"slug":4858,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4755,"rating":1440,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4859,"criticScoreSummary":4865,"genres":4867,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4870,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4871,"userScore":4872},1300728906,"S.T.A.L.K.E.R. 2: Heart of Chornobyl - Cost of Hope","stalker-2-heart-of-chornobyl-cost-of-hope",{"id":1440,"filename":4860,"dateCreated":4861,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":4862,"height":4863,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":4864,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1787151432.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},339,563,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1787151432.jpg",{"url":4866,"max":41,"score":3633,"reviewCount":1796,"positiveCount":3198,"neutralCount":45,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},"\u002Fgame\u002Fstalker-2-heart-of-chornobyl-cost-of-hope\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[4868],{"id":1440,"name":4869},"FPS","The fragile peace between Duty and Freedom stands on the brink of collapse. The heartlands of the Zone, forbidden for decades, now call to stalkers. New dangers - or perhaps wonders - begin to emerge.\r\n\r\nPrepare to embark on a new expedition into the Zone in this massive nonlinear expansion, where dozens of hours of gameplay, unforgettable stories, and twisted characters await. A new chapter of the S.T.A.L.K.E.R. saga begins - shaped by your choices and actions in a journey you must survive, endure, and explore.\r\n\r\nA chance to learn the Сost of Hope is upon us, stalkers.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":4873},8.3,{"id":4875,"type":1835,"typeId":4559,"title":4876,"slug":4877,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4755,"rating":1440,"seoUrl":1440,"image":4878,"criticScoreSummary":4882,"genres":4884,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":4887,"duration":18,"streamingDates":4888,"userScore":4889},1300503999,"Theropods","theropods",{"id":1440,"filename":4879,"dateCreated":4880,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":