e-jeong (Ji-hyun) is thrust into a bloody nightmare when a rapidly mutating virus is released during a biotech conference causing authorities to seal the facility. Trapped inside with no escape, Se-jeong along with a small group of survivors must fight to stay alive while the infected undergo horrific transformations.",122,{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":4750},{"id":4487,"type":1923,"typeId":45,"title":4438,"slug":4488,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4591,"rating":6312,"seoUrl":1440,"image":6452,"criticScoreSummary":6457,"genres":6458,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":6461,"duration":3489,"streamingDates":6462,"userScore":6463},{"id":1440,"filename":6453,"dateCreated":6454,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":2141,"height":6455,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":6456,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1778602195.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},1600,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1778602195.jpg",{"url":4490,"max":41,"score":1406,"reviewCount":1414,"positiveCount":2099,"neutralCount":969,"negativeCount":29,"sentiment":1972},[6459,6460],{"id":1440,"name":4935},{"id":1440,"name":5060},"When a lovesick musician is given the wrong number for his dream girl, he teams up with a driven psychology student to find her. Together, they spark a hilarious campus-wide frenzy that tests their own hearts and ambitions along the way.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailable