e the colorful world of \"It's Buddy!\", a group of children spend their days singing, dancing, and helping Buddy spread happiness. But when one child refuses to play along, Buddy is not pleased and cracks begin to appear in this seemingly perfect world.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":5146},{"id":6505,"type":1923,"typeId":45,"title":6506,"slug":6507,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4591,"rating":1440,"seoUrl":1440,"image":6508,"criticScoreSummary":6512,"genres":6514,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":6516,"duration":41,"streamingDates":6517,"userScore":6518},2000562388,"Filipiñana","filipinana",{"id":1440,"filename":6509,"dateCreated":6510,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":5463,"height":4928,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":6511,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1784312152.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1784312152.jpg",{"url":6513,"max":41,"score":4509,"reviewCount":986,"positiveCount":969,"neutralCount":45,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},"\u002Fmovie\u002Ffilipinana\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[6515],{"id":1440,"name":4959},"Amid stifling heat and pervasive drought, Isabel (Jorrybell Agoto), a 17-year-old Ilokana from the rural north, works at a posh country club outside Manila, lining up golf balls for powerful men to drive into the verdant horizon. New to the job, she wanders the immaculate grounds sampling its luxuries as members, including an industrialist and his expatriate niece, the club president and his pampered wife, and a slew of Chinese tourists, engage in a complex dance with the club’s doting and subservient staff. But something is rotting beneath the pristine fairways of the elite resort, as Isabel discovers when she tries to return a mislaid golf club to its patriarchal director, Dr. Palanca (Teroy Guzman). The deeper she journeys into its most exclusive corners, the closer she gets to the violent truths of the club, her native Philippines, and her own past.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":1440},{"id":6520,"type":1923,"typeId":45,"title":6521,"slug":6522,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":4719,"rating":1440,"seoUrl":1440,"image":6523,"criticScoreSummary":6527,"genres":6529,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":6533,"duration":3595,"streamingDates":6534,"userScore":6535},2000559921,"The Deb","the-deb",{"id":1440,"filename":6524,"dateCreated":6525,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":1874,"height":6455,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":6526,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1784574145.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1784574145.jpg",{"url":6528,"max":41,"score":2072,"reviewCount":983,"positiveCount":45,"neutralCount":240,"negativeCount":1238,"sentiment":1972},"\u002Fmovie\u002Fthe-deb\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[6530,6531],{"id":1440,"name":4935},{"id":1440,"name":6532},"Musical","An original comedy musical about two teenage girls attending a debutante ball in a small country town.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":1440},{"id":6537,"type":1923,"typeId":45,"title":6538,"slug":6539,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":6540,"rating":1440,"seoUrl":1440,"image":6541,"criticScoreSummary":6545,"genres":6547,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":6550,"duration":6551,"streamingDates":6552,"userScore":6553},2000563167,"How to Divorce During the War","how-to-divorce-during-the-war","2026-08-21",{"id":1440,"filename":6542,"dateCreated":6543,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":5463,"height":4928,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":6544,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1785772105.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1785772105.jpg",{"url":6546,"max":41,"score":3026,"reviewCount":547,"positiveCount":977,"neutralCount":1238,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},"\u002Fmovie\u002Fhow-to-divorce-during-the-war\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[6548,6549],{"id":1440,"name":4935},{"id":1440,"name":4959},"Vilnius, 2022. High-flying executive Marija (Zygimante Elena Jakstaite) chooses the worst possible moment to inform her husband Vytas (Marius Repsys) she wants a divorce: just one day before Russia’s invasion of Ukraine. Suddenly the couple must navigate the process of separation as it collides with a refugee and mid-life crisis. A struggling film director, Vytas is put into a tight spot by having to move in with his Russophile parents, while Marija struggles to find her footing as the war affects both her business and home life. As the reason for the divorce gradually becomes clear, the dissolution of Marija and Vytas’ marriage creates conflicts and opportunities for both of them, while also affecting their ever-observant young daughter Dovile. ",108,{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutu