40,"timezone":1440},"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1781711407.jpg",{"url":6605,"max":41,"score":6606,"reviewCount":240,"positiveCount":18,"neutralCount":45,"negativeCount":29,"sentiment":2046},"\u002Fmovie\u002Fhot-spot\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",28,[6608,6609,6610,6611,6612,6613],{"id":1440,"name":4841},{"id":1440,"name":4957},{"id":1440,"name":4959},{"id":1440,"name":5221},{"id":1440,"name":4963},{"id":1440,"name":4965},"In a near future society ruled by sentient A.I., a private eye investigates a murder case only to discover a rebel group capable of undermining the digital overlord. As the detective's identity slowly unravels, his world enters a state of hypnotic meltdown.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":1440},{"id":6618,"type":1923,"typeId":45,"title":6619,"slug":6620,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":6540,"rating":6357,"seoUrl":1440,"image":6621,"criticScoreSummary":6625,"genres":6627,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":6631,"duration":6632,"streamingDates":6633,"userScore":6634},2000562600,"The Magic Faraway Tree","the-magic-faraway-tree",{"id":1440,"filename":6622,"dateCreated":6623,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":2191,"height":2192,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":6624,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1782334753.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1782334753.jpg",{"url":6626,"max":41,"score":1917,"reviewCount":1423,"positiveCount":969,"neutralCount":977,"negativeCount":1238,"sentiment":1972},"\u002Fmovie\u002Fthe-magic-faraway-tree\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[6628,6629,6630],{"id":1440,"name":4886},{"id":1440,"name":6366},{"id":1440,"name":5221},"Adapted from Enid Blyton’s beloved classic novel, The Magic Faraway Tree centers on Polly (Claire Foy,), Tim (Andrew Garfield), and their three children - a modern family forced to relocate to the remote English countryside. As they adapt to their new lives, the children discover a magical tree and its extraordinary and eccentric residents, including treasured characters Moonface (Nonso Anozie), Silky (Nicola Coughlan), Dame Washalot (Jessica Gunning), and Saucepan Man (Dustin Demri-Burns). At the top of the tree, they are transported to spectacular, fantastical lands, and through the joys and challenges of their adventures, the family learns to reconnect and value each other for the first time in years.",110,{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":1440},{"id":6636,"type":1923,"typeId":45,"title":6637,"slug":6638,"premiereYear":4562,"releaseDate":6540,"rating":6377,"seoUrl":1440,"image":6639,"criticScoreSummary":6645,"genres":6647,"numberOfSeasons":18,"network":1440,"description":6653,"duration":3632,"streamingDates":6654,"userScore":6655},2000560888,"It Ends","it-ends",{"id":1440,"filename":6640,"dateCreated":6641,"alt":1440,"credits":1440,"path":1440,"cropGravity":1440,"crop":1440,"caption":1440,"typeName":1440,"imageUrl":1440,"width":6642,"height":6643,"sType":1440,"bucketType":1845,"bucketPath":6644,"mediaType":1440,"provider":1440},"7-1785434590.jpg",{"date":1440,"timezone":1440},8100,12000,"\u002Fprovider\u002F7\u002F2\u002F7-1785434590.jpg",{"url":6646,"max":41,"score":3026,"reviewCount":3108,"positiveCount":4764,"neutralCount":247,"negativeCount":18,"sentiment":1863},"\u002Fmovie\u002Fit-ends\u002Fcritic-reviews\u002F",[6648,6649,6650,6651,6652],{"id":1440,"name":4959},{"id":1440,"name":5221},{"id":1440,"name":5078},{"id":1440,"name":4963},{"id":1440,"name":4965},"A group of recent grads head out on a late night drive for grub, hoping to enjoy one final hangout before their paths diverge. Instead, they accidentally turn onto a never-ending, two-lane hellscape surrounded by untold horrors and cosmic forces beyond their understanding. Cramped together inside a Jeep Cherokee and with the miles stretching infinitely ahead, they face a choice: embrace their new existence or fight to escape it.",{"videoClosestPastAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableDate":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryDate":1440,"videoClosestPastAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureAvailableNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestPastExpiryNetworkId":1440,"videoClosestFutureExpiryNetworkId":1440,"networkStreamingDates":1440},{"score":5025},{"self":6657,"prev":6660,"next":6661,"first":6664,"last":6666,"tabs":6670},{"href":6658,"meta":6659},"https:\u002F\u002Fbackend.metacritic.com\u002Ffinder\u002Fmetacritic\u002Fweb?componentName=movies-carousel&componentDisplayName=Movies&componentType=ProductList&sortBy=-releaseDate&metaScoreMin=1&offset=0&limit=20&mcoTypeId=2",{"pageNum":1238,"count":4894},{"href":1440,"meta":1440},{"href":6662,"meta":6663},"https:\u002F\u002Fbackend.metacritic.com\u002Ffinder\u002Fmetacritic\u002Fweb?componentName=movies-carousel&componentDisplayName=Movies&componentType=ProductList&sortBy=-releaseDate&metaScoreMin=1&offset=20&limit=20&mcoTypeId=2",{"pageNum":45,"count":4894},{"href":6658,"meta":6665},{"pageNum":1238,"count":4894},{"href":6667,"meta":6668},"https:\u002F\u002Fbackend.metacritic.com\u002Ffinder\u002Fmetacritic\u002Fweb?componentName=movies-carousel&componentDisplayName=Movies&componentType=ProductList&sortBy=-releaseDate&metaScoreMin=1&offset=21540&limit=20&mcoTypeId=2",{"pageNum":6669,"count":45},1078,[6671,6672